          <tr><th scope="row">Average Exon size</th><td>290 bp</td></tr>
          <tr><th scope="row">Average Number of exons per gene</th><td>6 exons</td></tr>
          <tr><th scope="row">Maximum exons per gene</th><td>80 exons \(Zm00001eb126710_T002\)</td></tr>
          <tr><th scope="row">Average Intron size</th><td>578 bp</td></tr>
          <tr><th scope="row">Average Coding region size</th><td>1816 bp</td></tr>
          <tr><th scope="row">Average 5' UTR average length</th><td>n/a</td></tr>
          <tr><th scope="row">Average 3' UTR average length</th><td>n/a</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <h3 class="mgdb-leaf-heading mgdb-spaced">NCBI annotation releases</h3>
    <p class="gene-leaf-lead">NCBI annotates the same B73 assemblies independently of MaizeGDB, so a gene has an identifier in both. These are those releases and how they were built.</p>
    <div class="mgdb-prose gene-prose gene-prose-wide">
      <p>The <a href="http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/genome/annotation_euk/Zea_mays/103" target="_blank" rel="noopener">NCBI B73_v5 annotation release 103</a> for B73 v5 assembly, the <a href="http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/genome/annotation_euk/Zea_mays/101" target="_blank" rel="noopener">NCBI B73_v4 annotation release 101</a> and <a href="http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/genome/annotation_euk/Zea_mays/102" target="_blank" rel="noopener">NCBI B73_v4 annotation release 102</a> for the B73 v4 assembly, and the <a href="http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/genome/annotation_euk/Zea_mays/100" target="_blank" rel="noopener">NCBI B73_v3 annotation release 100</a> were developed at NCBI using the <a href="http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/genome/annotation_euk/process/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">NCBI Eukaryotic Genome Annotation Pipeline</a>. The final set of annotated features comprises, in order of preference, pre-existing <a href="http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/refseq/about/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">RefSeq</a> sequences and a subset of well-supported <a href="http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/genome/guide/gnomon.shtml" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Gnomon-predicted</a> models. It is built by evaluating together at each locus the known RefSeq transcripts, the features projected from curated RefSeq genomic alignments and the models predicted by Gnomon.</p>
    </div>

    <h3 class="mgdb-leaf-heading mgdb-spaced">Gene model issues</h3>
    <div class="gene-panel">
      <!-- These two pointed at /curation/GenomeIssue/edit and
           /curation/GeneModelIssue/edit. At the time that was a curator-login
           wall no reader of this page could pass; since community curation was
           retired on 2026-09-10, /curation/GeneModelIssue redirects to
           /contribute_data instead, so the wall is gone but the destination is
           still not where a gene-model report belongs. They open the same
           collector the legacy shell opened from
           `.trigger_gene_model_issue_form`, which is where these reports were
           meant to land. -->
      <p>We need your help! <a class="trigger_gene_model_issue_form" data-mgdb-feedback="gene_model" href="/feedback?kind=gene_model"><b>Please report any assembly or gene model structure problems</b></a>. This includes misassembled regions, evidence for closing gaps, gene models that should be merged or split, evidence supporting low-confidence gene models, et cetera. All issues will be shared with the maize community and with the team charged with improving the B73 assembly and gene models.</p>
      <ul class="gene-link-list">
        <li><a class="trigger_gene_model_issue_form" data-mgdb-feedback="gene_model" href="/feedback?kind=gene_model">Report a gene model error</a></li>
        <li><a href="/curation/geneModelIssues?status=open">All gene model issues</a></li>
        <li><a href="/curation/assemblyIssues?status=open">All assembly issues</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  

  

  

  <!-- ==================================================================
       7. References
       ================================================================== -->
  <section id="gene-references" aria-labelledby="gene-references-title">
    <div class="mgdb-section-heading">
      <div><h2 id="gene-references-title">References</h2></div>
    </div>

    <div class="mgdb-ref-list">
      $(reference_cards)
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ==================================================================
       12. Metrics
       ================================================================== -->
  <section id="gene-metrics" aria-labelledby="gene-metrics-title">
    <div class="mgdb-section-heading">
      <div><h2 id="gene-metrics-title">Metrics</h2></div>
    </div>

    <p class="gene-section-lead">The size and shape of the collection&#58; how many gene models each annotation contributes, and how the B73 reference set is distributed across the chromosomes.</p>

    <div class="mgdb-metric-grid">
      <article class="mgdb-metric mgdb-tone-green">
        <span class="mgdb-metric-icon" aria-hidden="true">GM</span>
        <div><strong class="mgdb-metric-value">$(total_gene_models)</strong><h3>Gene models</h3><p>Across every annotation currently loaded.</p></div>
      </article>
      <article class="mgdb-metric mgdb-tone-amber">
        <span class="mgdb-metric-icon" aria-hidden="true">An</span>
        <div><strong class="mgdb-metric-value">$(total_annotations)</strong><h3>Annotations</h3><p>Structural annotations of $(total_lines) maize lines.</p></div>
      </article>
      <article class="mgdb-metric mgdb-tone-blue">
        <span class="mgdb-metric-icon" aria-hidden="true">B73</span>
        <div><strong class="mgdb-metric-value">$(reference_models)</strong><h3>B73 reference models</h3><p>Gene models in $(reference_annotation), the recommended set.</p></div>
      </article>
      <article class="mgdb-metric mgdb-tone-burgundy">
        <span class="mgdb-metric-icon" aria-hidden="true">Loc</span>
        <div><strong class="mgdb-metric-value">$(curated_loci)</strong><h3>Curated loci</h3><p>Gene loci linked to at least one gene model.</p></div>
      </article>
    </div>

    <h3 class="mgdb-leaf-heading mgdb-spaced">Gene model counts by annotation</h3>
    <p class="gene-leaf-lead">$(annotation_note)</p>
    <figure class="mgdb-figure">
      <div class="mgdb-chart mgdb-chart-tall" id="gene-annotation-chart" role="img" aria-label="Horizontal bar chart of gene model counts in each current maize annotation, from the largest to the smallest">
        <span class="mgdb-chart-fallback">Loading annotation counts&hellip;</span>
      </div>
      <figcaption class="mgdb-visually-hidden">$(annotation_note)</figcaption>
      <details class="mgdb-chart-data">
        <summary>View the data behind this chart</summary>
        <div class="mgdb-table-scroll">
          <table class="mgdb-table" id="gene-annotation-table" data-sortable>
            <caption>Gene models in each current annotation</caption>
            <thead>
              <tr>
                <th scope="col" data-sort="text"><button type="button">Annotation</button></th>
                <th scope="col" data-sort="text"><button type="button">Line</button></th>
                <th scope="col" data-sort="number" class="mgdb-numeric"><button type="button">Gene models</button></th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody></tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </details>
    </figure>

    <h3 class="mgdb-leaf-heading mgdb-spaced">B73 gene models</h3>
    <p class="gene-leaf-lead">$(chromosome_note)</p>
    <figure class="mgdb-figure">
      <div class="mgdb-chart" id="gene-chromosome-chart" role="img" aria-label="Stacked bar chart of Zm00001eb.1 gene model counts on each chromosome, split by model type">
        <span class="mgdb-chart-fallback">Loading chromosome distribution&hellip;</span>
      </div>
      <figcaption class="mgdb-visually-hidden">$(chromosome_note)</figcaption>
      <details class="mgdb-chart-data">
        <summary>View the data behind this chart</summary>
        <div class="mgdb-table-scroll">
          <table class="mgdb-table" id="gene-chromosome-table">
            <caption>Zm00001eb.1 gene models by chromosome and model type</caption>
            <thead><tr></tr></thead>
            <tbody></tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </details>
    </figure>

    <figure class="mgdb-figure mgdb-spaced">
      <div class="mgdb-chart" id="gene-transcript-chart" role="img" aria-label="Bar chart of the number of Zm00001eb.1 gene models against how many transcripts each one has">
        <span class="mgdb-chart-fallback">Loading transcript distribution&hellip;</span>
      </div>
      <figcaption>$(transcript_note)</figcaption>
      <details class="mgdb-chart-data">
        <summary>View the data behind this chart</summary>
        <div class="mgdb-table-scroll">
          <table class="mgdb-table" id="gene-transcript-table">
            <caption>Zm00001eb.1 gene models by transcript count</caption>
            <thead><tr><th scope="col">Transcripts</th><th scope="col" class="mgdb-numeric">Gene models</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody></tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </details>
    </figure>
  </section>

  <!-- ==================================================================
       13. Other resources
       ================================================================== -->
  <section id="gene-related" class="mgdb-hub-related" aria-labelledby="gene-related-title">
    <div class="mgdb-section-heading">
      <div>
        <h2 id="gene-related-title">Related resources</h2>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mgdb-resource-panel">
      <div class="mgdb-resource-list">
        <a href="/genome/genomebrowser">
          <strong>Genome browser</strong>
          <span>JBrowse tracks for gene models on every assembly</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/pan_gene_center/pan_gene">
          <strong>Pan-Gene Data Hub</strong>
          <span>These same gene models grouped across assemblies</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/data_center/locus">
          <strong>Locus Data Hub</strong>
          <span>Classic genetic loci, alleles, and the phenotypes they carry</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/expression">
          <strong>Expression Data Hub</strong>
          <span>Expression atlases and qTeller comparisons for these models</span>
        </a>
        <a href="https://maizemine.rnet.missouri.edu/maizemine/begin.do" target="_blank" rel="noopener" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          <strong>MaizeMine</strong>
          <span>Build a gene model list and attach expression, pathway, and GO data</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <script id="gene-annotation-data" type="application/json">$(annotation_data)</script>
  <script id="gene-chromosome-data" type="application/json">$(chromosome_data)</script>
  <script id="gene-transcript-data" type="application/json">$(transcript_data)</script>

</main>
)
